# Exact pins of every development package, including the transitive ones. Nothing here is a runtime dependency:
# the package itself has none. `scripts/lock-dev.py` turns this file into requirements-dev.txt (with the sha256
# of every wheel for CPython 3.12/3.13 on Linux x86_64 and aarch64) and refuses any file that was uploaded to
# PyPI less than seven days before the cutoff (see scripts/check-dep-age.py). Bump a pin by editing it here.
